{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1650,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Airships seem like a bad idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4680,
    "dDurationMs": 1117,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exhibit A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5797,
    "dDurationMs": 1776,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright upbeat music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7573,
    "dDurationMs": 2177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's the greatest of\nmiracles that anyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9750,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "came out of the disaster alive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11940,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The Hindenberg was filled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13440,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with over 200 million liters of hydrogen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17040,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it also had an iron oxide\nand aluminum powder coating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20760,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on its outer shell,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22080,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "two of the ingredients that make thermite,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24480,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a mixture that undergoes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25560,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "such a strongly exothermic reaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27840,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is used to weld train tracks together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30990,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even if airships weren't\ngiant sacks of flammable gas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34710,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "encased in questionable coatings,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36960,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would still seem like a bad idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39990,
    "dDurationMs": 2463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they are big and slow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44430,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But right now, a handful of\ncompanies around the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47640,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are competing to build a\nnew generation of airships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52410,
    "dDurationMs": 1803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why are they doing it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57090,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I came across the following argument"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58860,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a blog by Eli Dourado\nand I found it compelling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62580,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I wanted to explore it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64980,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about how goods, all\nthe different types of stuff,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68520,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are transported around the U.S.."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71070,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A large amount of money is spent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72690,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "moving things around by airplane"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74760,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this doesn't translate\ninto a huge volume of goods"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78210,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because air transport is really expensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81510,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the fastest way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82590,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get something from one place to another"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84390,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you pay a premium for that speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87750,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to save money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89010,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can transport your goods\non ships using the waterways"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92460,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in and around the country\nbut that will be much slower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97320,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, since it's significantly cheaper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99660,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "far more goods are transported this way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102120,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and more money is spent on it overall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105690,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rail provides an even better option."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108150,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's faster than ships\nand cheaper than planes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110880,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so more goods are sent by train"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113130,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than by air and water combined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115530,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But by far the way that most\ngoods are moved around the U.S."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119880,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is by truck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121560,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's interesting about\nthis is that trucks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123750,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are not as fast as planes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125610,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they take several days to\nget across the country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128190,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are also not as cheap as ships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131370,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the combination of speed and price"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134340,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "puts them in this sweet spot\nof cheap enough and fast enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138810,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is why they transport\nthe vast majority of goods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143310,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are like the baby bears\nporridge of transport options,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147420,
    "dDurationMs": 1413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150030,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now consider how goods are\ntransported internationally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153660,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only options are planes and ships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156810,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, a lot of money is\nspent sending goods by air"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160050,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but because it's so expensive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161370,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the actual volume of goods is low."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163980,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And most goods, both in\nterms of dollars and weight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166830,
    "dDurationMs": 2283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are sent via ocean freight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170160,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what if there were a third option;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172260,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "faster than ships and cheaper than planes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175500,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems likely that most\ncustomers would prefer this new"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178770,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "truck-like method of transport."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181170,
    "dDurationMs": 2116,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Airships could be this option."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183286,
    "dDurationMs": 2564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright upbeat music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185850,
    "dDurationMs": 3256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They could be the trucks of the sky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189106,
    "dDurationMs": 2444,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright upbeat music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191550,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They would transport cargo\nacross oceans in around a week"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195030,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than a month for freighters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197100,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And theoretically, they would\nbe several times cheaper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200070,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than sending goods by plane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202290,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they would achieve all this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203610,
    "dDurationMs": 3783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while emitting significantly\nless emissions than planes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208320,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, while planes get\ntheir lift from their wings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210720,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so they need to burn a lot of jet fuel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212580,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just to stay in the air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214110,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "airships get their lift\neffectively for free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216990,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The buoyancy of lighter-than-air\ngas keeps them up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220170,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they don't need to move\nforward to stay aloft."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223650,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a result, modern airship\nmanufacturers estimate airships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227220,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can reduce carbon\nemissions by 90% or more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231240,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for airships to become\nthe trucks of the sky,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234150,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would have to carry a lot of weight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236100,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and historically, that has\nnot been a particular strength"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238830,
    "dDurationMs": 3273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of airships but that's\nwhere the physics comes in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244740,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The lift of an airship depends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246330,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the volume of light of\nan air gas it contains,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249270,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so lift is proportional to radius cubed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252930,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas drag depends on a\ncombination of the cross-sectional"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255990,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and wedded area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257850,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is basically the\nsurface area of the craft."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260490,
    "dDurationMs": 2823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's proportional to radius squared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264390,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This means the bigger you make an airship,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266610,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more efficient it becomes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268950,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lift goes up proportional to radius cubed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271320,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whereas drag only goes up\nproportional to radius squared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275190,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's a cubed squared\nadvantage for larger airships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279390,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Want to boost the\nperformance of your airship?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281670,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll just double it in size."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283830,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The area grows by a factor of four"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286260,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the volume by a factor of eight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288240,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So your lift to drag ratio doubles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290940,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If that's not enough,\njust double it again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293880,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To make airships the trucks of the sky,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296010,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we'd need to build"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296940,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the largest airships\nthe world has ever seen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300780,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are three different\nkinds of airships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303660,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is a blimp,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305310,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is basically a\nballoon with a gondola"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307440,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and motors attached."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309030,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like a balloon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309863,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is over-pressurized\nto maintain its shape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312930,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, the skin of a\nblimp is in constant tension."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316500,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As the blimp becomes larger,\nthis tension increases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320580,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Moreover, it becomes\nincreasingly difficult"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322920,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for larger blimps to maintain their shape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325440,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can't scale up blimps forever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329100,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second option is semi-rigid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331650,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like a blimp, the\nhull is still in tension"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334560,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yet now there's some\nadded structural support"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336840,
    "dDurationMs": 1113,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to maintain the shape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338970,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The last variety is a rigid body airship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342540,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These have an internal structure\nto maintain their shape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345720,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inside the hull, there\nare a series of gas cells"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348600,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "filled with a lifting gas\nlike hydrogen or helium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351690,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this case, the gas cells\nare not over pressurized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354360,
    "dDurationMs": 2343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so making them larger is no issue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357630,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The great thing about rigid airships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359670,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that they don't run into\nthe same scaling limits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362340,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Want a bigger airship?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363600,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just scale up the structure\nand add some extra gas bags."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367230,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, the weight of the\nstructure actually decreases"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370110,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a fraction of the total weight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372000,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so rigid airships scale even\nbetter than square cubed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376140,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's this last option"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377670,
    "dDurationMs": 2073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is best suited for the cargo market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380850,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what Eli proposes:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382680,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to build a 388 meter long rigid airship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386190,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to conquer the cargo market"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388800,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would be capable of\ncarrying 500 tons of goods"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392040,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a speed of 90 kilometers per hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394980,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's enough to carry\ntwo Statues of Liberty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397680,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the speed you drive down the highway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400470,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If built, it would be the\nlargest aircraft by far"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403950,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both in size and in how\nmuch weight it could carry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407610,
    "dDurationMs": 1923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not bad for an airship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410400,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But to take a significant\npiece of the cargo market,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412830,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you don't need just one airship,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415020,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need a fleet of thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416940,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "constantly moving goods around the globe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420210,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if they take over half"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421710,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the ocean freight container market"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423390,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a price comparable to trucks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425010,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say 10 cents per ton kilometer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427350,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would equal $650\nbillion of revenue per year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432600,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if that was all served by one company,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435030,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would be the biggest company\nin the world by revenue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438720,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bigger than Apple or Amazon or Walmart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442800,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So who is building these monster airships?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446820,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, at the moment, no one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449460,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This part of the video\nis sponsored by odoo.com."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453390,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like airships, many\nof our own dream projects"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456330,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can be hard to get off the ground"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459000,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the first step is always the same,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461160,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you just have to get started."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462870,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And whether you want to\nstart a business, a blog,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465300,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or a side hustle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466530,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one easy way to get started\nis to launch your own website."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469650,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This signals to the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471000,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yourself that you\nare really doing this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474210,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you want a fast, free and easy way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476010,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to launch your own website,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477180,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then check out this\nvideo sponsor, odoo.com."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480690,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just answer a few simple questions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482760,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "select your favorite theme and\nthen Odoo's powerful software"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486150,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "builds the core website for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488490,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you simply go to\nany block and change it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491823,
    "dDurationMs": 1437,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Want to add an image?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493260,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just select the image block"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494580,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and drag it to where you want it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496380,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next, click Replace to swap\nit with one of your own images"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499470,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or if you don't have an image,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500700,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just pick one of their free to use images."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503070,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adding a new page is also really easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505590,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just click New and add a\npage and then drag and drop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508950,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the blocks you want and you're done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510870,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With Odoo, making your own\nwebsite is a piece of cake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514290,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On top of that, Odoo also offers\neverything from accounting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517560,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to email marketing apps which\ncan be easily integrated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520800,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with your website."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521910,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With Odoo, your first\napplication is free for life,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524730,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including unlimited hosting and support"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526860,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a free custom domain\nname for one year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529950,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So head over to odoo.com/r/veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534780,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or click that link down in the description"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536970,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to start building your own website today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539520,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to thank Odoo for\nsponsoring today's show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544380,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While transporting cargo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545610,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is probably the largest\nmarket for airships,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548340,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's also one that's driven\nby fierce competition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550830,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and low margins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552660,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's not ideal when you\nneed to spend a lot of money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555420,
    "dDurationMs": 4006,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to first build, develop,\nand certify your airship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559426,
    "dDurationMs": 2564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What you want is a market\nwith less competition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561990,
    "dDurationMs": 1593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and better margins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565530,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the Airlander 10,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567420,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's built by the U.K.\ncompany Hybrid Air Vehicles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571050,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you tell me about the\nenvisioned use of the Airlander?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574950,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- They'll be going on extraordinary\nexperiential holidays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579210,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So going to the North\nPole, going on a safari,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582420,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going over the Amazon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584130,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knowing that they're making\nalmost no environmental impact,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587250,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "being able to travel in some luxury"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589410,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and see things that you\njust can't do another way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592530,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The first trips are scheduled\nfor no later than 2026."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596430,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Want to go on this trip, well,\nyou'd better start saving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599430,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because getting a cabin for two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601020,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will cost you about $200,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605550,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while a few companies are focusing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607590,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the luxury travel markets,\nothers plan to make use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610770,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of another unique advantage of airships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613800,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about what it normally\ntakes to move things around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616740,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trucks need roads, ships\nneed water and ports,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620160,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trains need railways and stations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622380,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and planes need long runways and airports."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625350,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Airships on the other hand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626730,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "require very little infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628860,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most important thing they need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630120,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a reasonably flat surface to land on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632880,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like grass, sand, ice or even water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637230,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's this unique\nability that allows them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639570,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to deliver goods where\nno truck, boat, train,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642300,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or plane can go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644100,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Airships can connect parts of the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645870,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that have been disconnected\nforever such as remote villages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649560,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Canada or Alaska"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651720,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they can do this with\nlittle to no infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655620,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or what if the roads, rails\nand ports have been destroyed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658470,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by a natural disaster?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660000,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Help is urgently needed to\nfind and support the survivors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663060,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there seems to be no way to get there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665190,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and no methods of communications\nonce you are there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668310,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, then airships could\nquickly rush to the scene"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671220,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to deliver rescue workers and supplies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673620,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or to provide cellular\nservice from the sky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676650,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Disaster relief missions like\nthese are what LTA Research,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679980,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is backed by Google\nco-founder Sergey Brin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682350,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is focusing on and they're\nmaking great progress."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686130,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their current prototype, the Pathfinder 1,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688050,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has completed multiple indoor flight tests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690900,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's scheduled to fly outside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692670,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sometime in the next few months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694740,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They plan to take the lessons\nthey learn from these tests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697590,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and build a series of airships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699840,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can provide help to\ndisaster stricken areas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703860,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Other times, roads may be available"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706080,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but what you're transporting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707280,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just isn't that compatible with roads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709830,
    "dDurationMs": 3423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like long, clunky and\nfragile turbine blades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714390,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To get them from the\nfactory to the destination"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716430,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "requires careful planning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717960,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and perfectly choreographed maneuvers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720360,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this process is what often limits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722340,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the size of wind turbines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724770,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Airships don't have that problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727110,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they can simply mount\nturbine blades of any size"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729750,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the bottom and carry\nthem to the destination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733020,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's much faster, easier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735180,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it allows you to build\nmore powerful wind turbines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738390,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus airships can also easily\ntransport other structures"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741870,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are hard to move."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743640,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But sometimes instead of delivering goods,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746160,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to pick them up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748920,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "France is full of natural\nresources like wood,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752700,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yet many of their forests\ncan't be reached by truck"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755670,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they can't actually extract the wood"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757500,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they've chopped down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759120,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The French company Flying whales,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761130,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "backed by the French government\nis hoping to change that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764820,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are developing this\n200 meter long cargo ship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767940,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's capable of\ncarrying a 60-ton payload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770880,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was designed to be able\nto hover above remote forests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773970,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and pick up logs which\ncould then be carried off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776460,
    "dDurationMs": 1383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and turned into timber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779220,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But loading and unloading from the sky"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781380,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "comes with significant problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783990,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For starters, you need to make\nsure that during this process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786570,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your airship stays still"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788490,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is more difficult than it sounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791310,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So a very large airship\nhas what we call sail effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793980,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even a relatively light current of wind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797130,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when multiplied by a\nreally, really large area"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801240,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is going to have a huge effect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802560,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that makes airships difficult to control"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805410,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially close to the\nground and at low speeds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808050,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they are a little bit unwieldy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810930,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- To overcome this, the airship\nis fitted with propellers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814050,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all around the hull that can stabilize it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816720,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But still this limits\nthe use of most airships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819360,
    "dDurationMs": 1563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to places with stable weather."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822690,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A bigger problem comes\nfrom the fundamental reason"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825660,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why airships work in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827610,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this issue is particularly\nbad for large cargo airships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832590,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, when an airship is\ncarrying a heavy load,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835200,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the combined weight of\nthe load and the airship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837270,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are offset by the lift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839160,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem arises when\nyou release that heavy load"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842190,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because now the airship\nis suddenly much lighter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845160,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so it wants to shoot up into the sky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847770,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you need some way to\nstop that from happening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851130,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Unless we can solve that problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853740,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're kind of dead in the water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855420,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in terms of airships for cargo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857790,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- A few methods have been\nproposed to solve this problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861000,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The easiest one is to decrease\nlift by venting lifting gas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865470,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only issue is that most\nmodern airships use helium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868650,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to offset say 60 tons of weight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870660,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would need to release"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871620,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about 54,000 cubic meters of helium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875160,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which costs a few\nhundred thousand dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878490,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not to mention that helium is scarce,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880380,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so venting it isn't\nreally a practical option."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883980,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, you could use propellers\nto push the airship down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887040,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that ends up burning so much fuel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889020,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it negates much of the advantage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890640,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of using airships in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893250,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The real dream has been to compress"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895560,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and decompress lifting gas\nbecause you take a lifting gas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898410,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when it is in gaseous form, it lifts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901920,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When it is compressed,\nit's ballast, it's heavy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904380,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there are some real\nproblems with that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906090,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you're talking about\na very large airship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908070,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a very large volume of lifting gas,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909870,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now you need a compressor that's capable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912060,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of compressing a tremendous\namount of gas very quickly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916110,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is just a technological problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918270,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we haven't really developed them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920400,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Until then, the short-term solution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922380,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to replace the weight you're releasing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924840,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you're dropping 60 tons of supplies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927090,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to pick up 60 tons of ballast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930150,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to pick up 60 tons of wood,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932160,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'd carry 60 tons of say water on board"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935550,
    "dDurationMs": 2073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and release it at the pickup location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938760,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's another innovative\nway to solve this problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941280,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's the secret behind\nhow the Airlander 10 works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944700,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It relies on a combination\nof lift from helium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947550,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and aerodynamic lift created by its hull."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950880,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We can lift the whole\nweight of the aircraft"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954660,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the helium inside\nso that effectively,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957420,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you're flying, that weighs nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959310,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And the aerodynamic lift"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960630,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is just there to lift the payload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963090,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So if we've, say, got\n100 people on board,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965880,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we take off like a conventional aircraft,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968250,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just at very low speed and we\ngenerate the aerodynamic lift"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971750,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to lift those people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973200,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The advantage then is that\nwhen we come down on the ground"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975930,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those people get\noff, we don't float away"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978870,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause we used aerodynamic lift"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980340,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which you can turn on and off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982830,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- While hybrid airships work well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984540,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for relatively light payloads,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986340,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're not ideal for\ncarrying heavy payloads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988710,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over long distances because\nyou would lose the advantage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991770,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of using free lift to\ncarry all that weight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995070,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for a large cargo airships,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996900,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the current best solution\nto the load exchange problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999270,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to replace the weight you're releasing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002960,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there are harder problems\nthat you need to overcome"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005450,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make airships the trucks of the sky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008120,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, no one has ever built a\n388 meter long airship before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012590,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how do you do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014690,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, normally airships are\nbuilt in humongous hangers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017600,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to protect them from the elements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019280,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the largest airship\nhanger that's ever been built"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021620,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was only 360 meters long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024230,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it wouldn't even fit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026270,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since you need to build\nthousands of these airships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028580,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you either have to find a way\nto magically construct scores"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031460,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of fragile airships outside\nor build lots and lots"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035690,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the world's largest hangers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037820,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If that wasn't hard enough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039080,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's also another problem\nthat needs to be solved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041420,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because each one of those\nairships must be filled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043760,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with over one million cubic\nmeters of lifting gas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047270,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which raises the age old question,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049670,
    "dDurationMs": 3264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you use hydrogen or helium?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052934,
    "dDurationMs": 1596,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Helium's really expensive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054530,
    "dDurationMs": 2948,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it has a lower lifting ability, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057478,
    "dDurationMs": 2082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hydrogen's really cheap\nbut it'll kill you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060650,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- After the Hindenburg burned\ndown in less than 40 seconds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063410,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the choice seemed obvious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065210,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only inert helium should\nbe used for airships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068090,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Federal Aviation Administration agreed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070370,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and hydrogen as a lifting gas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072200,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has been banned for many years now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074930,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what many people don't realize"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076550,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that of the 97 people on board,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079010,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more than 60 miraculously survived."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083060,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a few years earlier,\nanother airship, the USS Akron,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086420,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "crashed off the coast of New Jersey"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088460,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "killing 73 of the 76 people on board."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091670,
    "dDurationMs": 2853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that airship was filled with helium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095360,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So perhaps the issue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096650,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wasn't that hydrogen airships\nwere inherently unsafe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099630,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe we just didn't know\nhow to build safe airships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103430,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, we also didn't know\nhow to build safe planes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105800,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now they're one of\nthe safest ways to travel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108320,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for any plan that includes building"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110420,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and filling thousands\nof large scale airships,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113390,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hydrogen is the only realistic option"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116510,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because helium is too\nscarce and expensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119510,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hydrogen, on the other hand,\nis easy to produce, cheap"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122510,
    "dDurationMs": 2793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it provides about 8% more lift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126410,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then there's the\nissue of certification."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129260,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In general, certificating\nany new aircraft"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131390,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a really lengthy and expensive process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1133700,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're talking about\ncertificating an airship,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136070,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not only are you talking\nabout a brand new aircraft,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139040,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're talking about a\nbrand new type of aircraft."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142070,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No one has certificated\na large rigid airship in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146870,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, sort of ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149630,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Combine that with building\nthe largest aircraft"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151700,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the world has ever seen and filling it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153470,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with tremendous amounts\nof a highly flammable gas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156650,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you've got yourself\nanother pretty big challenge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160220,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But all of these problems\nmay not even matter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162890,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it might not be possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165170,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to build a 500 ton\ncargo ship of that size."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169460,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I mean, the most important\nthing of an airship structure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171410,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is needs to be light,\nit needs to be robust,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173030,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it needs to be strong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174020,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it needs to have really\ngood structural integrity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176540,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it needs to be light\nenough to get off the ground"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178460,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or there's no point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179480,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at a certain point of size,\nthe weight you need to add"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183530,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create the structural integrity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186050,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to operate safely,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188300,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, you reach a\npoint where those curves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190280,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just intersect in a bad way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192950,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there is a structural size limitation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196190,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "due to weight issues."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198920,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So how large is that size?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201470,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are not sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203360,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we do know is that\nright now several companies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1205850,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the world are\ndeveloping and building"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207710,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the next generation of airships."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209870,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For now, none of them are\nsetting out to develop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212000,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the trucks of the sky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213710,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, they're focusing\non areas where airships"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215960,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have a distinct advantage;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217430,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "markets with less competition\nand decent margins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220910,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who knows, perhaps as airships mature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223310,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one company will take the leap"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224780,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and set out to develop\nthese trucks of the sky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227570,
    "dDurationMs": 3873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It certainly won't be easy,\nbut the reward could be huge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232430,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you think we'll see a future where"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235430,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we've got these airships\nroaming all over our skies?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239270,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I know it may sound\ncrazy but we really do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240950,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It won't be very, very long"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242510,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before we get to see some stuff in the sky"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244850,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which will make a lot\nof people, including me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247310,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have really big smiles and\na lot of happy nostalgia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251240,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the great airships of the past."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253220,
    "dDurationMs": 3502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's very hard to break into\nthe world with a new thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1256722,
    "dDurationMs": 1785,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the world's not ready for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258507,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, there are many other things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259340,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that have become normal\nafter a bit of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262580,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's no reason why this shouldn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264200,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I hope when that day\ncomes someone will invite me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266480,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to come along and at least take a look,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269120,
    "dDurationMs": 2151,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if not have a ride in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1271271,
    "dDurationMs": 3083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(soft upbeat music)"
    } ]
  } ]
}
